  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Construction of a sports ground in Pervomaysk village</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Construction of a sports ground in Pervomaysk village</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Cie&#x13E;om mikrograntu je zlep&#x161;enie zdravotn&#xE9;ho stavu obyvate&#x13E;ov obce Pervomaysk vytvoren&#xED;m podmienok pre &#x161;portov&#xE9; aktivity. Vybuduje sa univerz&#xE1;lne &#x161;portovisko, obstar&#xE1; sa &#x161;portov&#xE9; vybavenie - 10 ks &#x161;portov&#xFD;ch zariaden&#xED;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to create a favorable environment for sports and preserve the health of rural residents. A universal sports ground will be built, sports equipment will be procured - 10 pcs of sports equipment</narrative>
